              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ngakho ngizamtshaya yena kanye lenzalo yakhe; kakuyikuba lamuntu wakwakhe ozasala phakathi kwalababantu abone okuhle engizakukwenzela abantu bami, ngoba ukhulumile ukuhlamuka kimi, kutsho iNkosi.",
          "type": "text",
